      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper describes a new technology - application of resorbable plates and pins for securing a laminotomy flap in children's neurosurgery. Four patients were operated on at our clinic. We describe in detail a surgical technique and compare it with a traditional fixation technique using ligatures."},
